11	// Percentage of children rebuilt by macro-mutation (fresh seed + conjugate) in SelCrossover.
12	// The only mutation operator - single-gene random mutation was removed.
13	#define MUTATION_RATIO 10
14	// Target (as a percentage of the population) for the number of DISTINCT seed sequences the host
15	// builds. Init pre-seeds that many specimens (specimenID < numSeeds) with a cubie-undoing sequence;
16	// the rest get fully random genes. The actual numSeeds is capped by how many distinct decompositions
17	// the active cubie has - often far fewer than the target (e.g. <= 3 for N=3, where the collateral
18	// axis is forced), so most of the population starts random and the real seeding pressure comes from
19	// macro-mutation, not Init.
20	#define SEED_RATIO 100
